edGuy.CoockiePuncher-20261002-155321.png", "id": "1744578966754173", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1744578970087506_184867581268551437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iHrS9KRP13gQ7kNvwFIJpKM&_nc_oc=AdqvfI6tC8wUOQLXC0NvYwLNR7B3p4fo8W_DDN9Kn95QovOMZ4c1nIOOl-KQ7hCC23k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVoqb4WaFeLcCI5rlX144ZvI38ZIDM2UDS6YbQfn2dhQ&oe=6AECA3E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt3Upscaled.png", "id": "1665458421844068", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1665458428510734_7766498067514048318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gu7bKfoWmKIQ7kNvwHQP7e4&_nc_oc=Adp8E_0PgS_9UZIDKdJoAEwKNpsj32xh1dnmCtSI1e8ilmIiXCa0zQUP6bMyAB5Va54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXaFpXmH5OEnZP5fv7nARyuN65YNZzONSkUMyUCAaEPQ&oe=6AECB2BD"}, "display_name": "Cookie Puncher", "keywords": ["Cookie", "Punching", "Workout", "Bakery", "Boxing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Cookie Puncher - the only place where smashing cookies is not just allowed\u2026 it\u2019s encouraged.\n\nStep into a  world where your fists are the ultimate baking tool. Punch, crush, fling, and obliterate cookies in wildly satisfying ways. Whether you're going for precision hits or full - on cookie carnage, every swing counts.\n\nBut don't get too comfortable - the Cookie Thief is always looking for a chance to ruin your fun. Stay sharp, keep punching, and prove who's really in charge of the kitchen!\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Features:\n\ud83c\udf6aPunch Cookies - Smash your way through cookies with your own fists.\n\ud83d\udca5Crunchy Feedback - Feel every hit as you pound cookies into pieces.\n\ud83d\uded2Shop & Customize - Unlock new items and customize your experience.\n\ud83e\uddb9\u200d\u2642\ufe0fChallenge the Cookie Thief - Keep an eye out for the thief and take on the challenge.\n\nPunch first. Ask quest